# GreenCart - Shopify Crypto Payment Plugin
**"Greenlight crypto in your shop!"**

A revolutionary Shopify plugin that enables merchants to seamlessly accept cryptocurrency payments with privacy-preserving identity verification, real-time blockchain indexing, and enterprise-grade reliability.

**Hosted @ : https://greencart-tyi.caffeine.xyz/ !**

## ✨ Overview
GreenCart is a production-ready Shopify plugin that bridges traditional e-commerce with the crypto economy. Built on cutting-edge blockchain infrastructure, it provides merchants with a zero-configuration solution to accept Bitcoin (BTC), Ethereum (ETH), Internet Computer Protocol (ICP), and Concordium PLT Stablecoin payments directly in their Shopify stores.

