## 🏗️ Architecture Philosophy

### Zero-Configuration Multi-Tenancy
GreenCart implements a shared backend canister architecture on the Internet Computer, eliminating the need for merchants to manage infrastructure. Each merchant's data is strictly isolated with enterprise-grade access controls, while benefiting from shared infrastructure reliability.

### Privacy-First Design
By integrating Concordium's privacy-preserving technology, we enable compliance-ready crypto payments without compromising user privacy. Identity verification happens on-chain with zero-knowledge proofs, ensuring both regulatory compliance and user anonymity.

### Real-Time Blockchain Intelligence
Our Python proxy server integrates with Envio's HyperIndex to provide instant blockchain data indexing across multiple chains. This enables real-time payment confirmations and accurate rate conversions without the latency of traditional blockchain explorers.

### Caffeine Hosting Reliability
Deployed on the Internet Computer's Caffeine infrastructure, GreenCart benefits from unstoppable, tamper-proof hosting with 99.99% uptime guarantees. The canister architecture ensures the backend remains permanently accessible after deployment.

## 🚀 Quick Start

### For Merchants
1. Install GreenCart from the Shopify App Store
2. Complete OAuth authentication
3. Configure your preferred cryptocurrencies
4. Start accepting crypto payments immediately

### For Developers
```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/Kevin-CNC/Encode-2025-Submission---GreenCart
cd Encode-2025

# Install frontend dependencies
cd app/frontend
npm install

# Install proxy server dependencies
cd ../../proxy-server
pip install -r requirements.txt

# Start development environment
npm run dev  # Frontend
python main.py  # Proxy server
```

